OL,3,AGirl faces six-month recovery after
OL,4,A'freak accident' bus crash on holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a girl who was crushed by
OL,7,Fa bus and trapped after it flipped
OL,8,Fwhile the family were on their first
OL,9,Fever holiday abroad has urged people
OL,10,Fnot to "scrimp" on travel insurance.
OL,12,FEmma Williams, from Llanrug in north
OL,13,FWales, said her 12-year-old daughter
OL,14,FGreta was left with a fractured sacrum
OL,15,Fand pelvis, after the bus lost control
OL,16,Fand fell on its side while overtaking
OL,17,Fanother vehicle during an excursion, in
OL,18,FAlanya, Turkey, last month.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
