OL,3,AGirl faces six-month recovery after
OL,4,A'freak accident' bus crash on holiday
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said Greta, whose care and
OL,7,Ftransport back to the UK was covered by
OL,8,Ftheir travel insurance policy, faced a
OL,9,Fsix-month journey to full recovery.
OL,11,FThe BBC has approached the company
OL,12,Fwhich put on the excursion, Tony
OL,13,FMontana Excursions, for comment.
